{"strongs": "H8096", "word": "שִׁמְעִי", "translit": "shim.i", "root": "שמעי", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "in Simeon", "definition": "I. שִׁמְעִי 43 proper name, masculine usually Σευεει : 1. in Benjamin: \\ \\ a. 2Sam 16:5 ; 2Sam 16:7 ; 2Sam 16:13 ; 2Sam 19:17 ; 2Sam 19:19 ; 2Sam 19:22 ; 2Sam 19:24 , 1Kgs 2:8 + 10 t. 1Kgs 2 . \\ \\ b. 1Kgs 1:8 , perhaps = 1Kgs 4:18 . 2. a Ramathite 1Chr 27:27 . 3. Levites: a. 'son' of Gershon Exod 6:17 ; Num 3:18 ; 1Chr 6:2 ; 1Chr 23:7 ; 1Chr 23:9 ; 1Chr 23:10 (twice in verse) \\ \\ b. 1Chr 6:14 . \\ \\ c. v. 1Chr 6:27 . d 1Chr 25:17 . \\ \\ e. 2Chr 29:14 . feminine 2Chr 31:12 ; 2Chr 31:13 . \\ \\ g. Ezra 10:23 . 4. brother of Zerubbabel 1Chr 3:19 . 5 in Simeon 1Chr 4:26 ; 1Chr 4:27 . 6. in Reuben 1Chr 5:4 . 7. 1Chr 8:13 = (II.) שֶׁמַע v 1Chr 8:13 . 8. post-exilic names: \\ \\ a. Ezra 10:33 . \\ \\ b. v Ezra 10:38 (compare 3 g above). 9. grandfather of Mordecai Esth 2:5 . 10. 2Sam 21:21 Kt ( Qr שִׁמְעָא q. v. 1. ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8835')\">BDB8835</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8096')\">H8096</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H8087')\">H8087</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H8092')\">H8092</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8834')\">BDB8834</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8836')\">BDB8836</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>שִׁמְעִי</bdbheb><sub>43</sub> <b>proper name, masculine</b> usually <grk>Σευεει</grk>: <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> in Benjamin:<br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"2Sam 16:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,16,5)\">2Sam 16:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 16:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,16,7)\">2Sam 16:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 16:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,16,13)\">2Sam 16:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,17)\">2Sam 19:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:19\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,19)\">2Sam 19:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:22\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,22)\">2Sam 19:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:24\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,24)\">2Sam 19:24</ref>, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,8)\">1Kgs 2:8</ref> + 10 t. <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,1)\">1Kgs 2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,8)\">1Kgs 1:8</ref>, perhaps = <ref ref=\"1Kgs 4:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,4,18)\">1Kgs 4:18</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a Ramathite <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:27\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,27)\">1Chr 27:27</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> Levites: a. 'son' of Gershon <ref ref=\"Exod 6:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,6,17)\">Exod 6:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 3:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,18)\">Num 3:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,2)\">1Chr 6:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,7)\">1Chr 23:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,9)\">1Chr 23:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:10\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,10)\">1Chr 23:10</ref> (twice in verse) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:14\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,14)\">1Chr 6:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 6:27\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,27)\">1Chr 6:27</ref>. <b>d</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,17)\">1Chr 25:17</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,14)\">2Chr 29:14</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,12)\">2Chr 31:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,13)\">2Chr 31:13</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:23\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,23)\">Ezra 10:23</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> brother of Zerubbabel <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,19)\">1Chr 3:19</ref>. <b>5</b> <highlightword>in Simeon</highlightword> <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:26\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,26)\">1Chr 4:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:27\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,27)\">1Chr 4:27</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> in Reuben <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,4)\">1Chr 5:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:13\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,13)\">1Chr 8:13</ref> = (II.) <bdbheb>שֶׁמַע</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Chr 8:13\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,13)\">1Chr 8:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>8.</b> post-exilic names: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:33\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,33)\">Ezra 10:33</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> v<ref ref=\"Ezra 10:38\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,38)\">Ezra 10:38</ref> (compare <b>3 g</b> above). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>9.</b> grandfather of Mordecai <ref ref=\"Esth 2:5\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(17,2,5)\">Esth 2:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>10.</b> <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:21\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,21)\">2Sam 21:21</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>שִׁמְעָא</bdbheb> q. v. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 16:5", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 16, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "2Sam 16:7", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 16, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "2Sam 16:13", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 16, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "2Sam 19:17", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 19, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "2Sam 19:19", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 19, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "2Sam 19:22", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 19, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "2Sam 19:24", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 19, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "1Kgs 2:8", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 2, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "1Kgs 2", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 2, "verse": 1, "chapterEnd": 2, "verseEnd": 200}, {"raw": "1Kgs 1:8", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 1, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "1Kgs 4:18", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 4, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "1Chr 27:27", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 27, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Exod 6:17", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 6, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Num 3:18", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "1Chr 6:2", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "1Chr 23:7", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 23, "ver